        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2115, Contemporary Privacy Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nModern Rectangular Privacy Pocket Door Set is a great choice for any sliding door where privacy is desired.  The Contemporary Privacy Mortise Pocket Door Hardware comes packaged with 2 flush pulls and a privacy function mortise box. The interior plate has a thumbturn and the exterior plate has an emergency release turn. It is available in a huge selection of finishes ranging from classic to trendy, so you will be sure to find just what you are looking for.  A privacy function locks but can be easily unlocked from the outside via an emergency turn.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/modern-rectangular-dummy-pocket-door-set-emtek-2116\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/modern-rectangular-passage-pocket-door-set-emtek-2114\"><b>Passage Set</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/modern-rectangular-keyed-entry-pocket-door-emtek-2113\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Privacy Modern Rectangular Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3.43\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 17/20\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Projection: 23/25\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2116-specifications.pdf?v=1704262358\"><b>Emtek 2115 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a privacy mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Rectangular Privacy Pocket Door Set",
                "description": "Modern Rectangular Privacy Pocket Door Set is a great choice for any sliding door where privacy is desired. It latches, but does not lock. The interior plate has a thumbturn and the exterior plate has an emergency release turn. The Contemporary Privacy Mortise Pocket Door Hardware comes packaged with 2 flush pulls and a privacy function mortise box. It is available in a huge selection of finishes ranging from classic to trendy, so you will be sure to find just what you are looking for. \r\n",
